    <div class="wb-cd-row"><img class="avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-003.webp" alt=""><div><p class="wb-cd-name">林晓</p><p class="wb-cd-meta">申请退款</p></div><span class="tag wb-cd-sp" data-tone="warning" data-st>待审批</span></div>
    <dl class="kv"><dt>金额</dt><dd><span class="price"><small>¥</small>199</span></dd><dt>商品</dt><dd>红玫瑰花束</dd><dt>原因</dt><dd>商品破损</dd></dl>
    <div class="wb-cd-acts"><button class="btn btn--outline" data-no>驳回</button><button class="btn btn--primary" data-yes>同意</button></div>
  </div></div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="WB-CARD-020" data-name="商品管理卡" data-cat="CARD">
