          <p class="wb-cd-cm__txt">花束很新鲜，配送也很准时，包装很用心</p>
          <div class="wb-cd-cm__acts"><button class="wb-cd-cm__like" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="点赞"><img data-ic="heart" src="../../kit/assets/icons/flat/heart.webp" alt=""><span data-n>12</span></button><button class="btn btn--text btn--xs" data-reply>回复</button></div>
          <div class="wb-cd-cm__replies">
            <div class="wb-cd-cm__reply" data-who="周岚">
              <img class="avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-015.webp" alt="">
              <div class="wb-cd-cm__main"><div class="wb-cd-cm__hd"><span class="wb-cd-name">周岚</span><span class="tag" data-tone="action">店长</span><span class="wb-cd-meta">昨天</span></div><p class="wb-cd-cm__txt">谢谢支持，欢迎下次再来</p><div class="wb-cd-cm__acts"><button class="wb-cd-cm__like" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="点赞"><img data-ic="heart" src="../../kit/assets/icons/flat/heart.webp" alt=""><span data-n>3</span></button><button class="btn btn--text btn--xs" data-reply>回复</button></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="expand" data-form><div><form class="wb-cd-cm__form" onsubmit="return false"><input class="input" placeholder="回复王芳" aria-label="回复内容"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" disabled>发送</button></form></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wb-cd-cm__item" data-who="陈默">
        <img class="avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-008.webp" alt="">
        <div class="wb-cd-cm__main">
          <div class="wb-cd-cm__hd"><span class="wb-cd-name">陈默</span><span class="wb-cd-meta">3 天前</span></div>
          <p class="wb-cd-cm__txt">颜色比图片更好看，就是花苞开得有点慢</p>
          <div class="wb-cd-cm__acts"><button class="wb-cd-cm__like" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="取消点赞"><img data-ic="heart" src="../../kit/assets/icons/flat/heart.webp" alt=""><span data-n>5</span></button><button class="btn btn--text btn--xs" data-reply>回复</button></div>
          <div class="wb-cd-cm__replies">
            <div class="wb-cd-cm__reply" data-who="周岚">
              <img class="avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-015.webp" alt="">
              <div class="wb-cd-cm__main"><div class="wb-cd-cm__hd"><span class="wb-cd-name">周岚</span><span class="tag" data-tone="action">店长</span><span class="wb-cd-meta">3 天前</span></div><p class="wb-cd-cm__txt">放在温暖的室内，两天左右就会完全开放</p><div class="wb-cd-cm__acts"><button class="wb-cd-cm__like" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="点赞"><img data-ic="heart" src="../../kit/assets/icons/flat/heart.webp" alt=""><span data-n>2</span></button><button class="btn btn--text btn--xs" data-reply>回复</button></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="wb-cd-cm__reply" data-who="陈默" hidden data-more>
              <img class="avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-008.webp" alt="">
              <div class="wb-cd-cm__main"><div class="wb-cd-cm__hd"><span class="wb-cd-name">陈默</span><span class="wb-cd-meta">3 天前</span></div><p class="wb-cd-cm__txt">好的，我试试看</p><div class="wb-cd-cm__acts"><button class="wb-cd-cm__like" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="点赞"><img data-ic="heart" src="../../kit/assets/icons/flat/heart.webp" alt=""><span data-n>0</span></button><button class="btn btn--text btn--xs" data-reply>回复</button></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="wb-cd-cm__reply" data-who="周岚" hidden data-more>
              <img class="avatar" src="../../kit/assets/marks/mark-015.webp" alt="">
              <div class="wb-cd-cm__main"><div class="wb-cd-cm__hd"><span class="wb-cd-name">周岚</span><span class="tag" data-tone="action">店长</span><span class="wb-cd-meta">3 天前</span></div><p class="wb-cd-cm__txt">如果还有问题随时联系我们</p><div class="wb-cd-cm__acts"><button class="wb-cd-cm__like" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="点赞"><img data-ic="heart" src="../../kit/assets/icons/flat/heart.webp" alt=""><span data-n>1</span></button><button class="btn btn--text btn--xs" data-reply>回复</button></div></div>
            </div>
